{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年44歲的性感女神莊韻澄（Xenia，前名莊端兒）經歷婚變陰霾後，早已重整旗鼓，將心思全數放在照顧愛兒「波子」以及個人事業上。一向不吝嗇展現火辣身材的她，近日在社交平台限時動態分享多張個人「Me time」浸浴照，大方露出迷人鎖骨與澎湃上圍，再度惹來網民熱議。自離婚後，莊韻澄一邊身兼父職獨力照顧愛兒，另一邊廂亦積極拓展多元化事業，並努力開拓直播帶貨的新血路。</p><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好好！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159159725443649536243796.png/bt54bCkCMHkUvziDsc7ZL6UUniWhjcC6yTC1F8kwtRc\"/><figcaption>Keep得好好！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好好！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159159722775941120561024.png/odoeq2WfspGSZKluN0gGG4OukjmdRyMXP9DJKz_QySs\"/><figcaption>Keep得好好！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>素顏上陣皮膚保養得宜</p><p>從莊韻澄發布的限時動態可見，身在浴室的她享受著難得的私密時光（Me time）。相中的她全素顏示人，敷著皮膚依然緊緻有光澤，完全看不出已年過四十。她更直接大膽地以超近鏡角度自拍，完美鎖骨及事業線一覽無遺，搭配浸浴時露出的一雙長腿，火辣指數依然爆燈。莊韻澄近年轉戰網上直播帶貨，憑藉直率性格與親和力吸納大量粉絲支持。面對生活與工作的雙重壓力，她依然保持最佳狀態，用行動證明單親媽媽同樣能活出獨立與自信。</p><figure><img alt=\"失婚人妻！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159161889671090176236798.png/9fLTCIfQ9TigOagBN54ZYXDe39x-wN-va2mdjGtpnYw\"/><figcaption>失婚人妻！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"失婚人妻！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159161886898524160213049.png/PhLNeHmKAQPMpN-Ty3xW73Vw5RwnWX3qII6H1yCOh9c\"/><figcaption>失婚人妻！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"失婚人妻！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159161884071432192189740.png/FuR-jn_q1v2zQxrHsUtyBDvtApGzNDXyh0LoLYdC6C0\"/><figcaption>失婚人妻！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好性感！（IG/@xeniachong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240703/885199621943463936085273.jpeg/-4xL3t08Qc6_lpwUxUeAtSnKb9NjOPaf_0Cenv9Anp4\"/><figcaption>好性感！（IG/@xeniachong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好！（IG/@xeniachong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241029/927946492746928128980137.jpeg/Eor5lTipMQb2I01Co1d8hfYZzpJnueMPEidlihInZYo\"/><figcaption>Keep得好！（IG/@xeniachong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唔似44歲！（IG/@xeniachong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241029/927947170236076032586043.jpeg/M6jF60Ly0FRscssWboTI6dZE8E69QndaU_B7xlPwe8Y\"/><figcaption>唔似44歲！（IG/@xeniachong）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T16:18:36.590629+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":527,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}